<STYLE ID="2">"That's..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="22">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> told me everything! In Megasawa, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> saved us, didn't she!?</STYLE>
