{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">As things are, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> safety can't be guaranteed. Maybe it'd be better, instead, to trust everyone and see it through to the end, they said. </STYLE>
